Bind Npc 16054 Zone 2

On greeting
    If quest 220 is started and player has 910053000
        Say "I am the Ranger of the Fourth Key! You possess the [Third Key], so you are qualified to hear the question. Will you accept the challenge?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "Who is the son of the emperor El Morad abandoned in the wilderness?"
            Topic "Manes" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910053000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. As a penalty, the [Third Key] you possessed has been destroyed. Now, I will leave to search for the secret of the keys elsewhere."
            Topic "Xigenon" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910053000
                    Give 1 of 910054000
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 220 is started
        Say "I am the Ranger of the Fourth Key! I only pose questions to those who bring the [Third Key]."
    Else
        Say ""
